ot pattern on one wing.</li>\n<li>Fold the paper over while the paint is still wet.</li>\n<li>Try making butterflies with different numbers of spots.</li>\n</ol>\n<p></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 24px;font-family: Chaloops-Medium;\">Questions</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>If you put 5 spots on one wing, how many will there be altogether?</li>\n<li>If you want 12 spots altogether, how many should you put on one wing?</li>\n</ul>\n", "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": false, "selectedModalId": 0, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}]